Style: Lemo-Opuscar «3D Map Explainer» (the globe of styles/map-explainer/demo, copied and adapted; set up from ../bh_map). Third-party data and sources:

## Imagery (downloaded by tools/fetch_world.py into raw/, processed into assets/world.jpg)
- Imagery: Sentinel-2 cloudless 2016 - https://s2maps.eu by EOX IT Services GmbH (Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data
  2016 & 2017), CC BY 4.0. Layer s2cloudless_3857, zoom 4 (whole Earth, 16 × 16 tiles), reprojected to an equirectangular
  globe texture. Only the 2016 release is used (later Sentinel-2 cloudless releases are CC BY-NC-SA). Imagery colour-graded
  (land warmed, deep ocean darkened; the caps beyond 85° filled with the colour of the 82–83.5° band) — "modified".
- Every download URL and date is logged in raw/manifest.jsonl (downloaded 2026-11-28).

